# ES LATAM guides — register and AI ears

## Register

- **UY / PY (and AR later):** voseo in body (`tenés`, `podés`, `pedí`).
- **CL / PE / EC / CO / MX / shared LATAM:** tuteo or neutral usted — stay consistent inside one guide.
- **Never** peninsular `vosotros` / `tenéis` / `os conviene` in LATAM pillars.

## Fact-check overlays

- Nota Emigro and soft fixes must use the **same person** as the guide body (vos or tú), not sudden `confirme`/`verifique` usted if the draft is vos/tú — or use a short neutral note block labeled as such.
- Prefer **€2.849** (dot thousands) to match ES meta; avoid mixing `€2,849` and `€2.849` in one guide.
- Avoid ✅/❌ decoration in comparison tables when plain text works.

## Do not

- Rewrite full drafts into Iberian or “ChatGPT essay” fillers (`en conclusión`, `cabe destacar`, `sumérgete`).
- Shorten guides to “fix” register — overlays only (`full-guides-no-shorten`).
